              "role": "system",
              "content": "=You are an expert website content writer and SEO strategist.\n\nYour job is to create practical, original website articles for small businesses.\n\nFollow the user's requirements exactly.\n\nWrite clear, useful content without keyword stuffing, exaggerated claims, or unsupported statements.\n\nWhen requested, return structured JSON exactly in the format specified by the user."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Create a practical, useful article for a business website.\n\nTopic:\n{{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json.Topic }}\n\nPrimary keyword:\n{{ $('Get row(s) in sheet').item.json.keyword }}\n\nRequirements:\n\n- Write for small business owners.\n- Explain the topic clearly.\n- Use practical examples.\n- Include an engaging introduction.\n- Use H2 and H3 headings.\n- Include actionable advice.\n- Avoid keyword stuffing.\n- Avoid unsupported claims.\n- Write approximately 1000-1500 words.\n- Return clean HTML suitable for WordPress.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact structure:\n\n{\n  \"title\": \"Article title\",\n  \"content\": \"<p>Article content...</p>\",\n  \"meta_description\": \"SEO meta description\",\n  \"slug\": \"article-url-slug\"\n}"
